---
// 03 — Holdings. The portfolio, reported like assets.
---
<section id="holdings" class="relative border-t border-ink/10 bg-paper-deep/40">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-20 md:py-28">
    <p class="reveal font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.3em] text-ink-faint uppercase">
      03 &mdash; Holdings
    </p>
    <h2
      class="reveal mt-6 font-display text-4xl font-medium tracking-tight text-ink md:text-5xl"
      style="--reveal-delay: 80ms"
    >
      Portfolio <em class="font-light">holdings.</em>
    </h2>
    <p class="reveal mt-5 max-w-xl leading-relaxed text-ink-soft" style="--reveal-delay: 140ms">
      Everything below was built in-house and is carried at full ownership. No acquisitions
      this year &mdash; growth was organic.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-12 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
      <article
        class="reveal border border-ink/15 bg-paper p-8 shadow-[0_16px_36px_-20px_rgb(22_19_16/0.3)] md:p-10"
      >
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
          <p class="font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.25em] text-ink-faint uppercase">
            Holding 01
          </p>
          <span
            class="border-2 border-ledger px-3 py-1 font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.25em] text-ledger uppercase"
            >Flagship</span
          >
        </div>
        <h3 class="mt-6 font-display text-3xl font-medium tracking-tight text-ink md:text-4xl">
          Poka
        </h3>
        <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
          Offline-first personal finance. Open-core to its bones &mdash; the Community Edition
          lives on GitHub under Apache 2.0, and the Premium tier is in Google Play review.
        </p>
        <dl class="mt-7 space-y-2 border-t border-ink/10 pt-6 font-mono text-[13px]">
          <div class="flex justify-between gap-4">
            <dt class="tracking-[0.15em] text-ink-faint uppercase">Origin</dt>
            <dd class="text-right text-ink">Built in-house, 2026</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="flex justify-between gap-4">
            <dt class="tracking-[0.15em] text-ink-faint uppercase">Structure</dt>
            <dd class="text-right text-ink">Open-core</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="flex justify-between gap-4">
            <dt class="tracking-[0.15em] text-ink-faint uppercase">Status</dt>
            <dd class="text-right text-ink">Premium in Play review</dd>
          </div>
        </dl>
        <div class="mt-7 flex flex-wrap gap-5 font-mono text-sm">
          <a
            href="https://getpoka.app"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-ink underline decoration-ledger/50 decoration-2 underline-offset-4 transition-colors hover:text-ledger"
          >
            getpoka.app <i class="ph ph-arrow-up-right"></i>
          </a>
          <a
            href="https://github.com/getpoka/poka-ce"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-ink-soft transition-colors hover:text-ink"
          >
            <i class="ph ph-github-logo text-base"></i> poka-ce
          </a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article
        class="reveal border border-ink/15 bg-paper p-8 shadow-[0_16px_36px_-20px_rgb(22_19_16/0.3)] md:p-10"
        style="--reveal-delay: 120ms"
      >
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
          <p class="font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.25em] text-ink-faint uppercase">
            Holding 02
          </p>
          <span
            class="border-2 border-ink/30 px-3 py-1 font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.25em] text-ink-soft uppercase"
            >Lab</span
          >
        </div>
        <h3 class="mt-6 font-display text-3xl font-medium tracking-tight text-ink md:text-4xl">
          Tako
        </h3>
        <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
          Self-hosted platform-as-a-service &mdash; a Dokploy-style control plane for shipping
          apps on your own servers. Carried as an R&amp;D asset.
        </p>
        <dl class="mt-7 space-y-2 border-t border-ink/10 pt-6 font-mono text-[13px]">
          <div class="flex justify-between gap-4">
            <dt class="tracking-[0.15em] text-ink-faint uppercase">Origin</dt>
            <dd class="text-right text-ink">Built in-house</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="flex justify-between gap-4">
            <dt class="tracking-[0.15em] text-ink-faint uppercase">Structure</dt>
            <dd class="text-right text-ink">Wholly owned</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="flex justify-between gap-4">
            <dt class="tracking-[0.15em] text-ink-faint uppercase">Status</dt>
            <dd class="text-right text-ink">Lab &rarr; production track</dd>
          </div>
        </dl>
        <div class="mt-7 font-mono text-sm">
          <a
            href="https://gettako.dev"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-ink-soft transition-colors hover:text-ink"
          >
            gettako.dev <i class="ph ph-arrow-up-right"></i>
          </a>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
